  "description": "XImage.OCR for C# library enables OCR feature to read Syriac text from image, scanned PDF in .NET Web, Windows applications.\n\nThis OCR language package includes :\n* Syriac language\n\nThis nuget package includes :\n* OCR (Optical Character Recognition) engine to convert image, multi-page TIFF, PDF to editable text content in .NET apps\n* Syriac language supported\n* Image document cleanup library to process image with digital noise, distortion, skewing\n\nAdditional features :\n* QR Code and 20+ barcode reading\n* Convert scanned PDF to text editable PDF documents\n\nInput :\n* Raster images : bitmap, png, jpeg, gif\n* Document : multi-page TIFF, PDF\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Standard 2.0\n* .NET 8, .NET 7, .NET 6, .NET 5\n* .NET Core 3.x, & 2.x\n* .NET Framework 4.6\n\n\nOnline Guides :\n* C# Developer Guide : https://www.rasteredge.com/how-to/csharp-imaging/ocr-sdk/\n* Support : support@rasteredge.com",
  "id": "XImage.OCR.Language.Syriac",
